The copyright holder may grant additional permissions separately from this public license.

For example, a creator who wishes to commercially publish a Tumblekin adaptation may contact the applicable rights holder and request a separate commercial license.

Granting such permission to one person does not change the CC BY-NC-SA 4.0 terms available to everyone else.

